  "finding": {
    "id": "SEGOVB-L3-TEXTURE-RECIPE-CHANNEL-ADMISSION",
    "classification": "Current source-derived conditional native asset admission failure; generated correct assets exclude the malformed recipe/channel case, no observed runtime incident",
    "lens": 3,
    "current_revision": "e2755a732c84e67296b5e3441a4259a84f461b2f",
    "first_failed_contract": "BakedRecipe::from_bytes validates map shapes and unique channels but does not establish that a channel belongs to its declared recipe before RuntimeTextureLoader admits it as RuntimeTextureRecipe. The installation consumer requires every supplied map channel to have a reserved destination for that same recipe.",
    "canonical_owner": "One TextureRecipeId-owned required/allowed map-channel contract, consumed at BakedRecipe/runtime asset admission and ProceduralTextureAssets::reserve; exact required-versus-allowed sparse map policy remains explicit.",
    "exact_function_ownership": [
      "bake/wire.rs::BakedRecipe::from_bytes60..123, map-header channel21/recipe12 and checks76..115",
      "runtime.rs::RuntimeTextureLoader::load110..136, filename121..129/maps130..135",
      "runtime.rs::ProceduralTextureResidency::destination64..74 and install_loaded_texture_recipes77..100, lookup90..93 before images94..96 and installed98",
      "runtime/handles.rs::ProceduralTextureAssets::reserve10..67, CrenellationMask63; load_map103..110; LeafTextureSet::load71..85/SurfaceTextureSet::load89..100",
      "bake.rs::BakedRecipe::generate98..129/generate_maps145..189/special_maps191..227, CrenellationMask221..224",
      "presentation/procedural_texture_setup.rs::setup_procedural_texture_assets11..37 reserves20..23 before optional eager request24..28",
      "bake/compressed.rs::BakedRecipe::from_compressed_bytes19..35 validates compressionextent then delegates wire admission"
    ],
    "producer_internal_api_retained_state_consumer_native_boundary": [
      "Native compressed ptex bytes\u2192bounded decompression/exact trailing check\u2192BakedRecipe.from_bytes shapes/uniquechannels without recipe-channel relation\u2192BakedRecipe raw channelset",
      "RuntimeTextureLoader compares filename stem to recipe.slug, then converts BakedMap\u2192nativeImage and retains private RuntimeTextureRecipe.maps",
      "Actual native startup reserves CrenellationMask/Opacity only; install consumes retained map.channel to destinations.get((recipe,channel)).expect before nativeAssets<Image>::insert and marking installed",
      "Concrete source-conditional input: recipe CrenellationMask/filename crenellation-mask.ptex, finitepositive tile, nonnegativeheight, Normalmap size1/mip1/R8 with1payloadbyte. Wire shape checks accept, filenamecheckaccepts, exact reservationhasnoNormaldestination. No container generated/decoded/run by audit."
    ],
